2Pe 2:1 , He foretells them of false teachers, shewing the impiety and punishment both of them and their followers;
2Pe 2:7 , from which the godly shall be delivered, as Lot was out of Sodom;
2Pe 2:10 , and more fully describes the manners of those profane and blasphemous seducers, whereby they may be the better known, and avoided.
